<TR><TD align=Right valign=top>
Description:</TD><TD>For all you tanks out there with the taunt ability. Remember to use our friend, the assist command; it's one of your best weapons against a large mob. Here's one method of using it.

When you see your healer/caster getting smacked up from a baddie you're currently not tankin (for whatever reason ya slacker =) hit the "F" key that corresponds to their place in the group (F3,F4 etc) to target them, then simply hit your assist hot key (which you have prepared beforehand "/assist") to target whatever is beatin on them. Then wail away.
Careful though, if ya hit the assist key while tanking a baddie you'll target the baddies target, which may leave you swinging at the caster next to ya. Which not all that bad really isn't very useful. =)
</TD></TR>



